{"id":"0941fdc1df502e5c","group":"27","path":"27/27-df-cotree.md","title":"Alternating cotrees, their graphs, and Boolean evaluation","display":"df-cotree — Alternating cotrees, their graphs, and Boolean evaluation","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-df-cotree","aliases":["27-df-cotree"],"display":"df-cotree — Alternating cotrees, their graphs, and Boolean evaluation","depends_on":["[[27-df-vardom]]","[[27-df-boolop]]"],"source_file":"C:/Users/lzy/Documents/BaiduSyncdisk/calibre/Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer/Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)/Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_section":"§10.4 cotree construction; §10.5 Remark 10.4","source_printed_pages":"464,467","source_pdf_pages":"488,491","verification_status":"source-definition-checked-explicit-tree-and-evaluation","local_review_status":"formally-reviewed-2026-10-20; source-not-rechecked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-df-cotree"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-df-cotree</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-cotree — Alternating cotrees, their graphs, and Boolean evaluation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4b84ee77aaf0c828\" href=\"?note=4b84ee77aaf0c828\" title=\"27-df-vardom\">27-df-vardom</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"11de8465f2282555\" href=\"?note=11de8465f2282555\" title=\"27-df-boolop\">27-df-boolop</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:/Users/lzy/Documents/BaiduSyncdisk/calibre/Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer/Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)/Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§10.4 cotree construction; §10.5 Remark 10.4"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"464,467"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"488,491"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-definition-checked-explicit-tree-and-evaluation"},{"key":"local_review_status","html":"formally-reviewed-2026-10-20; source-not-rechecked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[n],\\mathbb B\">\\([n],\\mathbb B\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"4b84ee77aaf0c828\" href=\"?note=4b84ee77aaf0c828\" title=\"27-df-vardom\">27-df-vardom</a>；有限标量合取、析取见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"11de8465f2282555\" href=\"?note=11de8465f2282555\" title=\"27-df-boolop\">27-df-boolop</a>。有限序列以函数编码；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(\\mathbb N^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\epsilon\">\\(\\epsilon\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\preceq\">\\(\\preceq\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u^\\frown j\">\\(u^\\frown j\\)</span> 由下式定义。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\mathbb N^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(T\\subseteq\\mathbb N^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span> 非空有限，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall u\\in T\\;\\forall v\\in\\mathbb N^{&lt;\\omega}\\;(v\\subseteq u\\Rightarrow v\\in T)\">\\(\\forall u\\in T\\;\\forall v\\in\\mathbb N^{&lt;\\omega}\\;(v\\subseteq u\\Rightarrow v\\in T)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\\subseteq[n]\">\\(V\\subseteq[n]\\)</span> 非空；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L_T,I_T,c_T\">\\(L_T,I_T,c_T\\)</span> 由下式定义，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda:I_T\\to\\mathbb B\">\\(\\lambda:I_T\\to\\mathbb B\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ell:L_T\\to V\">\\(\\ell:L_T\\to V\\)</span>。本节引入谓词 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cotree}\">\\(\\mathrm{Cotree}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E_T,\\Gamma_T\">\\(E_T,\\Gamma_T\\)</span> 仅在该谓词成立时定义，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma_T\">\\(\\Gamma_T\\)</span> 的顶点集为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span>。另引入函数族 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(A_u:\\mathbb B^n\\to\\mathbb B)_{u\\in T}\">\\((A_u:\\mathbb B^n\\to\\mathbb B)_{u\\in T}\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N^{&lt;\\omega}\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{k\\in\\mathbb N}\\mathbb N^{\\{j\\in\\mathbb N:j&lt;k\\}},\\qquad\\epsilon\\coloneqq\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathbb N^{&lt;\\omega}\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{k\\in\\mathbb N}\\mathbb N^{\\{j\\in\\mathbb N:j&lt;k\\}},\\qquad\\epsilon\\coloneqq\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"u\\preceq v\\Longleftrightarrow u\\subseteq v\\quad(u,v\\in\\mathbb N^{&lt;\\omega}),\\qquad u^\\frown j\\coloneqq u\\cup\\{(|\\operatorname{dom}(u)|,j)\\}\\quad(u\\in\\mathbb N^{&lt;\\omega},\\ j\\in\\mathbb N).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[u\\preceq v\\Longleftrightarrow u\\subseteq v\\quad(u,v\\in\\mathbb N^{&lt;\\omega}),\\qquad u^\\frown j\\coloneqq u\\cup\\{(|\\operatorname{dom}(u)|,j)\\}\\quad(u\\in\\mathbb N^{&lt;\\omega},\\ j\\in\\mathbb N).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"c_T(u)\\coloneqq\\{u^\\frown j\\mid j\\in\\mathbb N\\land u^\\frown j\\in T\\}\\quad(u\\in T).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[c_T(u)\\coloneqq\\{u^\\frown j\\mid j\\in\\mathbb N\\land u^\\frown j\\in T\\}\\quad(u\\in T).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lcp}(u,v)\\coloneqq\\bigcup\\{w\\in\\mathbb N^{&lt;\\omega}\\mid w\\preceq u\\land w\\preceq v\\}\\quad(u,v\\in T).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lcp}(u,v)\\coloneqq\\bigcup\\{w\\in\\mathbb N^{&lt;\\omega}\\mid w\\preceq u\\land w\\preceq v\\}\\quad(u,v\\in T).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"L_T\\coloneqq\\{u\\in T\\mid c_T(u)=\\emptyset\\},\\qquad I_T\\coloneqq T\\setminus L_T.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[L_T\\coloneqq\\{u\\in T\\mid c_T(u)=\\emptyset\\},\\qquad I_T\\coloneqq T\\setminus L_T.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cotree}(T,\\lambda,\\ell,V)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\ell:L_T\\overset{\\sim}{\\longrightarrow}V\\ \\land\\\n\\forall u\\in I_T\\;\\left(|c_T(u)|\\ge2\\land\n\\forall v\\in c_T(u)\\cap I_T\\;(\\lambda(v)=1-\\lambda(u))\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Cotree}(T,\\lambda,\\ell,V)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\ell:L_T\\overset{\\sim}{\\longrightarrow}V\\ \\land\\\n\\forall u\\in I_T\\;\\left(|c_T(u)|\\ge2\\land\n\\forall v\\in c_T(u)\\cap I_T\\;(\\lambda(v)=1-\\lambda(u))\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"E_T\\coloneqq\\{\\{\\ell(u),\\ell(v)\\}\\mid u\\in L_T,\\ v\\in L_T\\setminus\\{u\\},\\ \\lambda(\\mathrm{lcp}(u,v))=1\\},\\quad\\Gamma_T\\coloneqq(V,E_T)\\quad(\\mathrm{Cotree}(T,\\lambda,\\ell,V)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[E_T\\coloneqq\\{\\{\\ell(u),\\ell(v)\\}\\mid u\\in L_T,\\ v\\in L_T\\setminus\\{u\\},\\ \\lambda(\\mathrm{lcp}(u,v))=1\\},\\quad\\Gamma_T\\coloneqq(V,E_T)\\quad(\\mathrm{Cotree}(T,\\lambda,\\ell,V)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A_u(x)\\coloneqq x_{\\ell(u)}\\quad(u\\in L_T,\\ x\\in\\mathbb B^n).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A_u(x)\\coloneqq x_{\\ell(u)}\\quad(u\\in L_T,\\ x\\in\\mathbb B^n).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A_u(x)\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\n\\bigvee_{v\\in c_T(u)}A_v(x)&amp;\\lambda(u)=0,\\\\\n\\bigwedge_{v\\in c_T(u)}A_v(x)&amp;\\lambda(u)=1\n\\end{cases}\\quad(u\\in I_T,\\ x\\in\\mathbb B^n).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A_u(x)\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\n\\bigvee_{v\\in c_T(u)}A_v(x)&amp;\\lambda(u)=0,\\\\\n\\bigwedge_{v\\in c_T(u)}A_v(x)&amp;\\lambda(u)=1\n\\end{cases}\\quad(u\\in I_T,\\ x\\in\\mathbb B^n).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 §10.4 与 Remark 10.4，印刷 pp.464,467／PDF pp.488,491。叶标签无重复，内点0/1交替；图中相邻恰在叶的最近公共祖先标签为1。公共前缀按函数图包含关系成有限链，其并集是唯一最长公共前缀；T前缀闭保证它仍属于T。不同叶的lcp必为内点，故λ调用合法。求值从叶向根按有限高度递归，唯一给出布尔值。用0对应∨、1对应∧得到read-once表达式；对子树无需额外隐藏标签约定。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-vardom","status":"resolved","id":"4b84ee77aaf0c828","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-vardom]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-boolop","status":"resolved","id":"11de8465f2282555","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数