phs, and Boolean evaluation]]"},{"id":"dfd688b37f7bc20d","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$；$(T,\\lambda,\\ell,V)$ 满足 [[27-df-cotree]] 的 $\\mathrm{Cotree}$，子树图族 $(G_w)_{w\\in T}$ 和极大团族 $\\mathcal K$ 见 [[27-thm-cotreecliques]]。$I_T,c_T,\\preceq$ 取该 cotree 定义。$s_w,L_w$ 对每个 $w\\in T$ 由下式定义。"},{"id":"2da3d3afc8d114e5","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$；$(T,\\lambda,\\ell,V)$ 满足 [[27-df-cotree]] 的 $\\mathrm{Cotree}$，$V\\subseteq[n]$；$L_T,I_T,c_T,\\Gamma_T,\\preceq$ 取该定义。$H$ 是任意有限简单图；$\\mathrm{Vert},\\mathrm{Edges}$、诱导子图见 [[27-df-graphops]] 及其上游 [[27-df-graph]]。$J$ 为有限集，$\\mathcal A_j\\subseteq\\mathcal P(V)$（$j\\in J$）；$V_v,G_v,\\mathcal K,\\bigotimes$ 由下式定义。"},{"id":"5b42b5bd5b357f2f","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$；$(T,\\lambda,\\ell,V)$ 满足 [[27-df-cotree]] 的 $\\mathrm{Cotree}$，$\\varnothing\\ne V\\subseteq[n]$，$A_\\epsilon:\\mathbb B^n\\to\\mathbb B$ 与 $\\Gamma_T$ 取该定义。$\\mathcal M,G,\\mathrm{Normal}_n$ 见 [[27-df-cooccurrence]]；$\\mathrm{PosReadOnceFunc}_n$ 见 [[27-df-readoncefunc]]，极大团族 $\\mathcal K$ 见 [[27-thm-cotreecliques]]。"}],"outgoing":["4b84ee77aaf0c828","11de8465f2282555"]}